-D reconstruction of neurons from confocal image stacks</article-title>. <source>Neuroimage.</source><volume>23</volume>, <fpage>1283</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1298</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15589093</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Segev</surname><given-names>I.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>2000</year>). <article-title>Untangling Dendrites with Quantitative Models</article-title>. <source>Science.</source><volume>290</volume>, <fpage>744</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>750</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11052930</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>